<title>AUSTRIA: Austria sees CA decision by weekend.</title>
<headline>Austria sees CA decision by weekend.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian government aims to reach a decision on the sale of number two bank Creditanstalt-Bankverein by the weekend, Economy Minister Johann Farnleitner said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We agreed that there will be a decision by the weekend,&quot; Farnleitner told reporters. He and Finance Minster Viktor Klima are together evaluating offers for the bank.</p>
</text>
